# Map shipped GPU config keys to the arch class their tuning targets. Runtime
# fallback uses this to avoid crossing architecture boundaries when a device
# name is new but its SM is already represented by a shipped config. AOT
# precompile uses the same map to scope variants to the right arch class, so
# new shipped GPU config keys must be registered here.
